-----THERMAL NEUTRON SCATTERING DATA                                13 1451
------ENDF-6                                                        13 1451
 Liquid ortho deuterium at 19k computed with LEAPR.                 13 1451
 The scattering law is based on the model of Keinert and Sax,       13 1451
 which includes spin correlations from the Young and Koppel         13 1451
 model, diffusion and local hindered motions from an                13 1451
 effective translational scattering law based on a frequency        13 1451
 distribution, and intermolecular coherence after Vinyard.          13 1451
